      "source_type": "X",
      "raw_text": "I was supposed to fly to Cebu this coming Saturday for another 8-day vacation. I had plans to visit @infinity_spa_ph Cebu again and finally try the newly opened @cebu_alpha. But because of a recent accident and incident, I need to take a step back and focus on healing—so I’m canceling the trip for now.🥹😞😩\n\nGood thing I was able to store the value of my flight in my travel fund (thank you, @CebuPacificAir!). For now, I’ll just stay home and rest up, so I can hopefully squeeze in some spa time next week.😉\n\nThankfully, I’ve got a bunch of holidays coming up—Aug 19 (Quezon City Day), Aug 21 (Ninoy Aquino Day), and Aug 25 (National Heroes Day), plus weekends and the WFH setup.☺️\n\nSo there’s definitely enough time to rest, recover, and ease back in.😊🤿",
      "cleaned_text": "I was supposed to fly to Cebu this coming Saturday for another 8-day vacation. I had plans to visit Cebu again and finally try the newly opened . But because of a recent accident and incident, I need to take a step back and focus on healing—so I’m canceling the trip for now.🥹😞😩 Good thing I was able to store the value of my flight in my travel fund (thank you, !). For now, I’ll just stay home and rest up, so I can hopefully squeeze in some spa time next week.😉 Thankfully, I’ve got a bunch of holidays coming up—Aug 19 (Quezon City Day), Aug 21 (Ninoy Aquino Day), and Aug 25 (National Heroes Day), plus weekends and the WFH setup.☺️ So there’s definitely enough time to rest, recover, and ease back in.😊🤿",
      "english_translation": "If you don't mind to fly to Cebu this coming Saturday for your 8-day vacation. Iad plan to vite Cupbu and fially the newly opened . Butcause of a correct time identification and inident, need to change a step bit on his new text.",
